<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/27aefaf478ad> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6690] Steven Michael Hendrickson, 35, died when his Tesla Model 3 hit an overturned semi on the freeway at around 2.30am." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6690" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8d30789cb22e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6690] At least 3 people have previously died in crashes involving the automated driving system, which can ensure that the car stays in its lane and remains at a safe distance from other vehicles on highways." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6690" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/daaf336188f8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6690] A man behind the wheel of a Tesla who ended up in a fatal crash had previously posted videos and images of himself in the moving car without his hands on the wheel or his foot on the pedal while in autopilot mode." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6690" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5c59e268c879> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "CHP has not said if officials have determined whether the Tesla in the I80 incident was on autopilot, which can keep a car centered in its lane and a safe distance behind vehicles in front of it.",
        "CHP has not said if officials have determined whether the Tesla in the I80 incident was on autopilot, which can keep a car centered in its lane and a safe distance behind vehicles in front of it. But it’s likely that either autopilot or full self-driving were in operation for the driver to be in the back seat." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6577" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/97edf26aab31> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A man behind the wheel of a Tesla who ended up in a fatal crash had previously posted videos and images of himself in the moving car without his hands on the wheel or his foot on the pedal while in autopilot mode." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6690" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/01c18343b432> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "“Every time we spoke to him, he would light up talking about his kids and loved his Tesla,” Tesla Club-SoCal posted on Instagram." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6577" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/02d05840d872> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In a letter to the department of transportation on 1 February, the National Transportation Safety Board Chairman Robert Sumwalt wrote: “Because [the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration] has put in place no requirements, manufacturers can operate and test vehicles virtually anywhere, even if the location exceeds the [autonomous vehicle] control system’s limitations.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6690" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/03213de2def4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "After the Florida and California fatal crashes, the National Transportation Safety Board (NTSB) recommended Tesla develop a stronger system to ensure drivers are paying attention, and limit use of autopilot to highways where it can work effectively." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6577" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/123831021cd0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The New York Police Department said that early on July 26, a 52-year-old man was hit by a Tesla and killed while changing a flat tire on his vehicle." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6454" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4b77e77ba9ae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The department identified the victim as Jean Louis of Cambria Heights, New York." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6454" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6da38a74325f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "California Highway Patrol said on Thursday that the autopilot “was engaged” before the crash, in which another man was seriously injured as he was struck by the Tesla while he was helping the driver of the overturned semi get out of the vehicle." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6690" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/70e365a9fac1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The New York Police Department said that early on July 26, a 52-year-old man was hit by a Tesla and killed while changing a flat tire on his vehicle, which was parked on the left shoulder of the Long Island Expressway in Queens." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8095" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c33e22e2257f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The department identified the victim as Jean Louis of Cambria Heights, New York." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8095" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c8b6e5f482dd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The incident took place on 5 May in Fontana, a city 50 miles east of LA, and is being investigated by the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6690" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d8bb97b29f24> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In March, the NHTSA sent a team to investigate after a Tesla on autopilot ran into a Michigan state police vehicle on I96 near Lansing." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6577" .

